# ERATON project site gate (Netlify Identity, invite only). The record page and everything under /projects/
# open only for a signed-in user with the viewer or owner role; anyone else gets the sign-in page, served at
# the address they asked for. /login.html itself is not gated.
/              /index.html          200!  Role=viewer,owner
/index.html    /index.html          200!  Role=viewer,owner
/projects/*    /projects/:splat     200!  Role=viewer,owner
/              /login.html          401!
/index.html    /login.html          401!
/projects/*    /login.html          401!
